# The product

```json
{
  "name": "SoloStudio",
  "summary": "SoloStudio is for a solo freelance UX designer whose clients, notes, tasks and bookings are currently scattered across email, notes and spreadsheets. It brings clients, follow-up notes, projects and tasks, availability and public bookings into one private workspace. The designer tracks follow-ups and work from a home dashboard, while visitors book an available session from her public booking page.",
  "audience": "A solo freelance UX designer managing her own clients, projects and bookings, and the people who book sessions with her without an account."
}
```

# Vocabulary

```json
[
  {
    "noun": "Client",
    "description": "A person or company the designer works with: name, email, optional company, short profile and status Lead, Active or Past.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Note",
    "description": "A dated note under a Client from a call, with an optional follow-up date that can be marked done or pushed a week.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Project",
    "description": "Work for a Client with a name, short description and optional due date, holding Tasks.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Task",
    "description": "A task in a Project with a title, status To do, In progress or Done, priority Low, Medium or High and an optional due date.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Availability",
    "description": "The designer's weekly availability: which days and from what time to what time she can be booked.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "SessionType",
    "description": "A kind of bookable session with duration, displayed price and maximum people, such as a discovery call, design review or Figma workshop.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Slot",
    "description": "A bookable time for a SessionType generated from Availability, full when its Bookings reach the SessionType maximum; cancelling it cancels all its Bookings.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  },
  {
    "noun": "Booking",
    "description": "One person's place on a Slot, made with name and email, linked to a Client by matching email or creating a Lead, cancellable via its on-screen link.",
    "belongsTo": "designer"
  }
]
```

